  "details": "Pins, Anchor, and Fly are all needed to control the position and selection of multiple cameras.  Since Fly was added it pushed Pins and Anchor onto separate sides of the setting scroll so it is very hard to get between them quickly while streaming.\n\nMy suggestion is that you take all 3 of those settings and make them 1 \"Position\" button which then displays 2 rows of buttons below.  pins on the first row, then on row 2, fly, followed by the other anchor settings.  This would also be another good opportunity to add more pins.",
